{"_meta":{"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Finished comment request in Lightbringer","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Adding comment in Lightbringer\u2026"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Comment on a record in Lightbringer"},"description":"Starts a comment thread on a quoted passage of an invention disclosure, a patent draft (priority application draft or application text) or a commentable report, or replies to a thread. Changes no record text. Mentioned users with access are notified. Every request posts a new comment, so a repeated request posts it twice. A new thread cannot overlap an open thread; it takes over a resolved thread's highlight, and that thread remains, detached. Returns a status; an ambiguous passage returns each occurrence with a ready selector, and a missing one returns hints.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"action":{"description":"add starts a thread; reply adds to an existing one","enum":["add","reply"],"type":"string"},"block":{"description":"add: the paragraph the passage is in, as an ambiguous answer names it in a selector","maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"comment":{"description":"The comment text","maxLength":2000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"prefix":{"description":"add: text immediately before the passage, in the same paragraph","maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"quoted_text":{"description":"add: the passage to anchor the thread on, copied from the record text as fetch with include_asset renders it. It is matched against the text as stored when the comment is added","maxLength":4000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"section":{"description":"add: the section the passage is in: for a disclosure problem, solution, details, priorArt or shortcomings; for any other record, a key of its asset data.sections (a report names a section body by its id and its title <