},"kind":{"const":"inline","type":"string"},"quotedText":{"type":"string"},"section":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","section","block","quotedText"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"const":"section","type":"string"},"section":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","section"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"const":"detached","type":"string"},"path":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["kind"],"type":"object"}]},"candidates":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"block":{"type":"string"},"commentable":{"const":false,"type":"boolean"},"contextAfter":{"type":"string"},"contextBefore":{"type":"string"},"quotedText":{"type":"string"},"section":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"block":{"type":"string"},"prefix":{"type":"string"},"quoted_text":{"type":"string"},"section":{"type":"string"},"suffix":{"type":"string"}},"required":["quoted_text"],"type":"object"}},"required":["section","contextBefore","quotedText","contextAfter"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"commentId":{"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"},"hint":{"type":"string"},"hints":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"instructions":{"type":"string"},"mentionedUserIds":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"replacedResolvedThreadIds":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"status":{"enum":["created","replied","resolved","reopened","deleted","ambiguous","not_found","overlapping","refused","unsupported"],"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"},"threads":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"quotedText":{"type":"string"},"threadId":{"type":"string"}},"required":["threadId","quotedText"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"total":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"unchanged":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["status"],"type":"object"},"title":"Comment on a record in Lightbringer"}
